# Only the website and this repo's own files are committed.
# Everything else in this folder stays on this computer: videos, audio,
# captions, YouTube upload kits, scripts, animation code and artwork.
#
# The rules ignore everything at the top level, then let back in only the
# lines starting with "!". To start committing another top-level folder,
# add a line like:  !/tools/

/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/LICENSE-CONTENT.md
!/NOTICE.md
!/docs/

# Never commit these, even inside docs/.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.m4v
*.webm
*.mkv
*.wav
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.aac
*.flac
*.srt
*.vtt
*.zip
*.psd
*.blend

# Operating system and editor clutter.
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.vscode/
.idea/
